      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "text": "Job dr_models_replicate. Runs in WEST (secondary) as ad-dr-spn (app-id dc5781bc-c86f-4808-a00c-930062f91f17), pulls the EAST registry over the MLflow API using secret scope dr_remote_east (no compute on EAST). One-off, full history, clean restore point. No S3 CRR: artifacts stream via API to the WEST staging volume.",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Job dr_models_replicate. Runs in WEST (secondary) as ad-dr-spn (app-id dc5781bc-c86f-4808-a00c-930062f91f17), pulls the EAST registry over the MLflow API using secret scope dr_remote_east (no compute on EAST). One-off, full history, clean restore point. No S3 CRR: artifacts stream via API to the WEST staging volume.",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": false,
      "baseline": 12
    },
