      "fontSize": 11,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "text": "Job     : dr_models_replicate   (resources/dr_models_jobs.yml)\nCadence : MANUAL one-off  (NOT scheduled -- baseline = one-time restore point)\nRuns in : WEST (secondary)   run_as: ad-dr-spn (app-id dc5781bc-c86f-4808-a00c-930062f91f17)\nCommand : databricks bundle run dr_models_replicate -t west\nNotify  : on_failure -> ankita.darekar@databricks.com",
